        {
            "text": "1.0​ Purpose",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "1.1​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "This document establishes the procedure for XYZ at Inmar, Inc. and its wholly and",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "partially owned subsidiaries (collectively referred to as “Inmar”).",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "2.0​ Scope",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "2.1​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "This standard operating procedure (SOP) applies to XYZ.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "3.0​ Responsibilities",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "3.1​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Content for Responsibilities",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "4.0​ Definitions",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "4.1​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Content for Definitions",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "5.0​ Procedure",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "5.1​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Content for Procedure",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.0​ Compliance",
            "style": "H2"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.1​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "SOP review cadence",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.1.1​ This SOP shall be reviewed biennially.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.1.2​ This SOP shall also be reviewed upon significant changes to Inmar’s business,",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "regulatory, and/or technical environment that could impact the content of this",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "document.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.2​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Compliance Measurement",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.2.1​ The Information Security Governance, Risk, and Compliance team will verify",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "compliance to this SOP through various methods, including but not limited to,",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "business tool reports, internal and external audits, and feedback to the author.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.3​",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Sanctions",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "6.3.1​ Inmar’s sanction policy applies appropriate sanctions, up to and including",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "termination, against Inmar team members who fail to comply with Inmar’s",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "Information Security Policies and Procedures. Sanctions occur with appropriate",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "involvement of Inmar’s human resources and legal departments.",
            "style": "H3"
        },
        {
            "text": "​",
            "style": "Normal"
        },
        {
